# Optional — pull the FULL ~246-name equity universe straight from the retail
# securities_c table (the same names the dashboard uses). Copy this file to
# `.env` and fill in. Without these, the downloader uses a bundled JSE
# large/mid-cap fallback list (~80 names).
#
# These are the SAME values the Railway iress-ingest worker already uses for
# the retail DB. The anon key is enough (read-only); the service-role key also
# works.
RETAIL_SUPABASE_URL=
RETAIL_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# or, read-only:
# RETAIL_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
